# 方法論（MANDATORY）

> **2026-07-29 更新**：BDD（Cucumber）已廢除。單人 vibe coding 場景下，vibe prompt 即 BDD。

## 完整流程圖（task-router 分流後）

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph ENTRY[Task Router 入口]
        A[User Request] --> B[saome-task-router]
        B --> C{L1/L2/L3/EscapeHatch}
    end
    
    subgraph L1[L1 Trivial]
        C -->|L1| D[直接實作]
        D --> E[lint]
        E --> F[npm test]
    end
    
    subgraph L2[L2 Standard]
        C -->|L2| G[test-driven-development]
        G --> H[Failing Test]
        H --> I[Implementation]
        I --> J[npm test]
        J --> K[verification-before-completion]
    end
    
    subgraph L3[L3 Heavy]
        C -->|L3| L[brainstorming]
        L --> M[Decision Log]
        M --> N[test-driven-development]
        N --> O[Failing Test]
        O --> P[Implementation]
        P --> Q[npm test]
        Q --> R[run-smoke-tests]
        R --> S[requesting-code-review]
        S --> T[verification-before-completion]
    end
    
    subgraph L3E[L3 Escape Hatch]
        C -->|Escape Hatch| L3
    end
    
    subgraph FINISH[完成]
        K --> U[finishing-a-development-branch]
        T --> U
        U --> V[saome-self-improvement]
        V --> W[完成]
    end
```

## 流程說明

| 環節 | 工具/Skill | 產出 |
|------|------------|------|
| Task Router | `saome-task-router` | 任務級距判定 |
| 創意發想 | `superpowers:brainstorming` | design doc（L3 Heavy） |
| Decision Log | `runs/decisions/` | 三段式決策紀錄（L3 Heavy） |
| TDD 實作 | `superpowers:test-driven-development` | *.test.tsx |
| 冒煙測試 | `superpowers:run-smoke-tests` | smoke test report |
| Code Review | `superpowers:requesting-code-review` | review report |
| 最終驗證 | `superpowers:verification-before-completion` | verification report |
| 完成分支 | `superpowers:finishing-a-development-branch` | branch merged/PR |

## 觸發時機（task-router 分流表）

| 任務級距 | 觸發條件 | 必走流程 |
|----------|----------|----------|
| L1 Trivial | 改 UI 屬性 / 修 typo / 改文案 | 直接做 → lint → test |
| L2 Standard | 新 L1/L2 元件 / 一般 bug fix | TDD → Verification |
| L3 Heavy | 新功能涉及多模組 / 架構改動 | Brainstorming → Decision Log → TDD → Review → Smoke |
| L3 Escape Hatch | L3 + 需求含糊 / 跨系統整合 | L3 Heavy + Spec-Kit 完整流程 |

